Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.43,0:16:07.93,67e8c4caed35114ebb94955d,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Интересно.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.95,0:16:12.01,67e8c4caed35114ebb94955e,Gray,0,0,0,,И 4.5 такая, и OTA, и MINI такая.
